        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "LETTER OF UNDERSTANDING\nRELATING TO THE TRAVEL CARD PROCESS",
            "block_bbox": [
                222,
                91,
                540,
                132
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    222.0,
                    91.0
                ],
                [
                    540.0,
                    91.0
                ],
                [
                    540.0,
                    132.0
                ],
                [
                    222.0,
                    132.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Company and the Union enter this Letter of Understanding to memorialize their agreement to continue to monitor the process of paying business travel expenses and their ongoing mutual commitment for improvements in the same.",
            "block_bbox": [
                66,
                149,
                697,
                211
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    66.0,
                    149.0
                ],
                [
                    697.0,
                    149.0
                ],
                [
                    697.0,
                    211.0
                ],
                [
                    66.0,
                    211.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In addition to the terms and conditions defined by the Company, the following provisions continue to apply to the travel card process:",
            "block_bbox": [
                66,
                226,
                696,
                268
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    66.0,
                    226.0
                ],
                [
                    696.0,
                    226.0
                ],
                [
                    696.0,
                    268.0
                ],
                [
                    66.0,
                    268.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Employees will not be required to pay the card company for authorized business expenses before receiving payment from Travel Accounting so long as the delay in receiving that payment is due to the Company's neglect of factors outside the employee's control.",
            "block_bbox": [
                92,
                282,
                696,
                345
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    92.0,
                    282.0
                ],
                [
                    696.0,
                    282.0
                ],
                [
                    696.0,
                    345.0
                ],
                [
                    92.0,
                    345.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. If due to obvious employee neglect, payment to the card company is not made within sixty (60) days of receiving the invoice, the employee will be responsible for paying a 2.5 percent fee plus $10. The Company will pay any such fees that are incurred due to its neglect or because of process delays outside the employee's control. Any dispute over the imposition of such fees will be subject to Article 3.",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                359,
                696,
                459
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    91.0,
                    359.0
                ],
                [
                    696.0,
                    359.0
                ],
                [
                    696.0,
                    459.0
                ],
                [
                    91.0,
                    459.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. In the event an employee has a disputed billing with the card company, the employee shall follow the guidelines for dispute resolution listed on the reverse side of the travel card invoice. The employee may contact Travel Accounting for assistance, and both will work cooperatively to resolve disputes.",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                474,
                697,
                555
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    91.0,
                    474.0
                ],
                [
                    697.0,
                    474.0
                ],
                [
                    697.0,
                    555.0
                ],
                [
                    91.0,
                    555.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Payment delinquencies will not be reported to a credit bureau unless the card company prevails in an action to collect the unpaid debt. Such legal action shall not commence unless the unpaid invoice is the employee's responsibility and the invoice has been left unpaid for over 180 days.",
            "block_bbox": [
                90,
                570,
                696,
                632
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    90.0,
                    570.0
                ],
                [
                    696.0,
                    570.0
                ],
                [
                    696.0,
                    632.0
                ],
                [
                    90.0,
                    632.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. Authorized management may exempt employees who engage in extensive/frequent travel or for whom special circumstances exist from the decentralized billing process. Any employee shall be free to request an exemption.",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                647,
                696,
                708
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    91.0,
                    647.0
                ],
                [
                    696.0,
                    647.0
                ],
                [
                    696.0,
                    708.0
                ],
                [
                    91.0,
                    708.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. The Company will take reasonable steps to preserve the confidentiality of the employee's personal and financial information related to the use of the travel card, and will use such information only for legitimate business reasons. Such information will not be used for solicitations for activities not related to Company travel.",
            "block_bbox": [
                89,
                723,
                696,
                803
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 9,
